---
   
---
<section id="hero" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#0A101D] pt-32 pb-40 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">

    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-10 bg-[url('/circuitos.svg')] bg-repeat"></div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-64 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#6B8CFF] to-transparent z-0"></div>
    
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-8 bg-gradient-to-t from-white to-transparent blur-md z-0 opacity-80"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-8 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-tight text-[#E2E8F0]">
            El núcleo tecnológico que <br> 
            <span class="text-kernel-green">impulsa tus ideas</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-8 text-sm md:text-base text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed">
            Desarrollamos plataformas web integrales que conectan tus necesidades con resultados reales, optimizando tu tiempo y recursos.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-6 w-full">
            <button class="bg-[#476A8A] text-white font-semibold text-sm px-8 py-3 rounded-md shadow-lg hover:bg-opacity-90 transition">
                Iniciar Proyecto
            </button>
            <button class="bg-kernel-green text-[#1A1A1A] font-semibold text-sm px-8 py-3 rounded-md shadow-lg hover:bg-opacity-90 transition">
                Conocer más
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>   
</section>